  "schema:name": "GdhcnTrustAnchor",
  "dcterms:title": "GDHCN trust anchor",
  "dcterms:description": "WHO's GDHCN, which receives participants' PKI material and distributes it as DID trust lists; Trust Network Anchor (SMART Trust), Trust Anchor (IHE ITI VHL).\n\n**Persona**: A WHO service publishing DID documents over did:web; verifiers fetch it when online and keep a copy.\n\n**Also known as**: Trust Network Anchor (SMART Trust); Trust Anchor (IHE ITI VHL)\n\n**Played in the journeys by** (fictional):\n\n- GDHCN DEV trust network (WHO)",
